<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN"
  "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<!--
  Template, installed alongside the nightly job by
  `autonomous_work_settings.py`. Same work, started a different way: this one has
  no schedule at all and exists only to be kickstarted by the native host when
  the popup's "Do next todo" button is pressed. (The popup's "Trigger a full
  run" button kickstarts the nightly label directly and needs no agent here.)

  It exists because launchd cannot be asked to start a job with extra arguments,
  and a single-shot run by hand must skip the pace gate — hence --force baked in
  here, where the nightly job takes none.

  Why route the button through launchd rather than spawning the scheduler from
  the host, which is fewer moving parts: everything the host spawns is a
  descendant of Chrome, and macOS stamps com.apple.quarantine on files written
  by any descendant of a quarantine-aware app. That includes the ad-hoc-signed
  .node module `claude` unpacks the first time a prompt touches an image, which
  then cannot load without an "Apple could not verify..." dialog. Started by
  launchd, the run has no such ancestor. It also gives the button and the
  nightly job identical filesystem permissions, so what you see when you press
  it is what happens at 2 AM.

  Every placeholder here is substituted textually, so do not name one in prose.

  PATH matters more than anything else here: launchd starts jobs with a bare
  environment, and both `uv` and `claude` install under the home directory
  rather than on the default path. A missing PATH entry shows up as
  "command not found" in system.log and nothing else.
-->
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.claudeusageoptimizer.autonomouswork.ondemand</string>

  <!-- A named wrapper rather than /usr/bin/env, so listings show
       "claude-usage-autonomous-work" instead of "env". -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__/backend/claude-usage-autonomous-work</string>
    <string>--force</string>
  </array>

  <key>WorkingDirectory</key>
  <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__</string>

  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__/backend/system.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>__PROJECT_ROOT__/backend/system.log</string>

  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>__HOME__/.local/bin:/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/usr/sbin:/sbin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>__HOME__</string>
  </dict>

  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <false/>
</dict>
</plist>
